  "infoPorts": {
   "en": "Every port of the reference (curated/reference/port_geometry), by pid, the key the logbooks, landings and AIS data join on: one geometry each, from the sources in their order. Iceland's and the Faroes' areas are drawn by hand; elsewhere they come from GISCO, EMODnet, OpenStreetMap, Global Fishing Watch and others. An area shows from zoom 8, a point further out. A port call is measured against the area (decision 074).",
   "is": "Allar hafnir viðmiðunartöflunnar (curated/reference/port_geometry), eftir pid, lyklinum sem afladagbækur, landanir og AIS-gögn tengjast á: ein lögun hver, úr heimildunum í forgangsröð. Svæði íslenskra og færeyskra hafna eru teiknuð í höndunum; annars staðar koma þau frá GISCO, EMODnet, OpenStreetMap, Global Fishing Watch og fleirum. Svæði sést frá aðdrætti 8, punktur fjær. Hafnarkoma er mæld við svæðið (ákvörðun 074)."
  },
